  triage:snippet "async def _dispatch_nudge(self, chat_key: str, body: str) -> None: ... source = SessionSource(platform=telegram_platform, chat_id=self._chat_id, chat_type='dm', user_id=self._chat_id, user_name=chat_key) — every sender routed into the same configured Telegram chat_id, sender kept only in user_name." ;
